   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Special Grade Boon. When players reach level 20, they are generally expected to be capable enough to battle Special Grades. A GM can choose to give these players Special Grade Boons as rewards and power-ups to help in the battle against those nasty curses.</em></p><p>A number of times equal to twice your proficiency bonus, you can add your proficiency bonus to an attack or damage roll you make, even if you would already add it. You regain all expended uses on a long rest.</p>",
